        "citations": null,
        "text": "Great question \u2014 and it's genuinely debated! Here's a breakdown of the main pronunciations:\n\n---\n\n## How to Pronounce \"Doge\" \ud83d\udc15\n\n",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": [
          {
            "cited_text": "According to Wikipedia, the meme can be pronounced /do\u028a\u0292/ or /do\u028ad\u0292/ or /do\u028a\u0261/, though all I&#x27;ve heard from the media is /do\u028a\u0292/. ",
            "encrypted_index": "Eo8BCioIEBgCIiRkMmJjZWZjOS0wNDQwLTQxYWUtOTM0Mi1hNDFhNjdkYWIzZWQSDDot6U+OXJieSPU02xoM7bKFc0seuUHkpDbjIjBgQoe2+0mmeYhznTrb4/sP7hdA4FbdnC1vZ6b5tNN6IeCr8wug3iti2dKbsrEpLr4qE5x4wSk55wlHVsIXPve8/YxZ/4sYBA==",
            "title": "Language Log \u00bb Pronouncing DOGE",
